Here is a Delphi code snippet for finding the intersection of two arrays ar1 and ar2:

```
var
  ar1, ar2, intersect: TArray<Integer>;
  i, j, k: Integer;
begin
  // Initialize input arrays
  ar1 := [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6];
  ar2 := [2, 4, 6, 8, 10];

  // Initialize output array
  SetLength(intersect, Min(Length(ar1), Length(ar2)));
  k := 0;

  // Loop through arrays and find common elements
  for i := Low(ar1) to High(ar1) do
  begin
    for j := Low(ar2) to High(ar2) do
    begin
      if ar1[i] = ar2[j] then
      begin
        intersect[k] := ar1[i];
        Inc(k);
        Break;
      end;
    end;
  end;

  // Copy the intersection array to a new array with the correct length
  SetLength(intersect, k);

  // Print the intersection array
  for i := Low(intersect) to High(intersect) do
    WriteLn(intersect[i]);
end.
```

In this example, we initialize the input arrays ar1 and ar2 with some sample data. We then create a new array called intersect to store the common elements of ar1 and ar2. We loop through both arrays and compare each element, adding it to the intersect array if it is found in both arrays. Finally, we resize the intersect array to remove any empty space and print its contents.

Note that this implementation has a time complexity of O(n^2), which may not be efficient for large arrays. There are faster algorithms available for finding the intersection of arrays, such as using a hash set or sorting the arrays and performing a merging algorithm.

解析H.264流和AAC流是一个相对复杂的过程，特别是在不使用ffmpeg库的情况下。然而，你可以选择使用其他开源库或者通过手动解析流中的NALU单元（H264）或ADTS帧（AAC）来实现。

对于H.264流，你可以使用开源库 x264（https://www.videolan.org/developers/x264.html）或OpenH264（https://github.com/cisco/openh264）。这些库提供了一系列用于解析H.264流的API。以下是使用x264库解析H.264流的简单示例：

```cpp
#include <x264.h>
#include <stdint.h>
#include <stdio.h>

void parse_h264_stream(const uint8_t *buffer, int length) {
    x264_nal_t *nal = NULL;
    int i_nal = 0;

    int result = x264_nal_decode(&nal, &i_nal, (uint8_t *)buffer, length);
    if (result < 0) {
        printf("Error decoding H.264 stream\n");
        return;
    }

    for (int i = 0; i < i_nal; i++) {
        x264_nal_t *current_nal = &nal[i];
        printf("NAL unit type: %d\n", current_nal->i_type);
    }

    x264_nal_release(nal);
}
```

对于AAC流，FAAD2（http://www.audiocoding.com/downloads.html）是一个用于解析AAC音频流的库。以下是使用FAAD库解析AAC流的简单示例：

```cpp
#include <neaacdec.h>
#include <stdint.h>
#include <stdio.h>

void parse_aac_stream(const uint8_t *buffer, int length) {
    NeAACDecHandle handle = NeAACDecOpen();

    NeAACDecConfigurationPtr conf = NeAACDecGetCurrentConfiguration(handle);
    conf->outputFormat = FAAD_FMT_16BIT; // output format, left as default
    NeAACDecSetConfiguration(handle, conf);

    long unsigned int sample_rate;
    unsigned char channels;
    int result = NeAACDecInit(handle, (uint8_t *)buffer, length, &sample_rate, &channels);
    if (result < 0) {
        printf("Error initializing AAC decoder\n");
        NeAACDecClose(handle);
        return;
    }

    NeAACDecFrameInfo frame_info;
    void *sample_buffer = NeAACDecDecode(handle, &frame_info, (uint8_t *)buffer, length);

    if (frame_info.error > 0) {
        printf("Error decoding frame: %s\n", NeAACDecGetErrorMessage(frame_info.error));
    } else {
        printf("AAC frame decoded successfully\n");
    }

    NeAACDecClose(handle);
}
```

请注意，这些示例假定你已经从输入流或文件中读取了原始的H.264或AAC数据。要手动解析这些格式，你需要了解H.264和AAC的详细规范，比如ISO/IEC 14496-10（H.264）和ISO/IEC 14496-3（AAC）。

